  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Studies of aseptic meningitis after mumps vaccination, grouped by vaccine strain (Jeryl Lynn/RIT 4385, Urabe Am 9, Leningrad 3, L-Zagreb, Torii, Hoshino). For each study the table gives the country, number of doses, population vaccinated, how cases were ascertained and the incidence per 100 000 doses.",
